      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "David Ross Estate Agents your local property experts are delighted to present 143 Stannaway Road to the market, a charming two-bedroom, one-bathroom end-of-terrace home offering an excellent opportunity for first-time buyers, downsizers and investors alike.\r\nSteeped in local history, Stannaway Road forms part of the established Crumlin/Kimmage area, which evolved considerably throughout the 20th century from a predominantly rural landscape into the thriving residential neighbourhood we know today. The surrounding area has retained a strong sense of community, with its parks, sporting facilities and established residential streets adding to its enduring appeal.\r\nPositioned at the end of the terrace, the property benefits from the additional privacy and natural light that this desirable position can provide. The accommodation offers well-proportioned living space together with two comfortable bedrooms and a main bathroom, making it an ideal home for those looking to put their own stamp on a property.\r\nThe location is particularly appealing, with a host of local amenities, schools, shops, cafés and recreational facilities all within easy reach. The area is also well served by public transport and provides convenient access to Dublin City Centre and surrounding suburbs.\r\nWith its attractive end-of-terrace position, practical two-bedroom layout and highly established location, 143 Stannaway Road represents a wonderful opportunity to acquire a home in a popular and well-connected Dublin neighbourhood.\r\nViewing is highly recommended.\r\nFeatures\r\n\r\nEnd of Terrace\r\nDouble glazed through out\r\nG.F.C.H\r\nKitchen Extension\r\nSouthern rear aspect\r\nLow maintenance Garden\r\nPrime location"
      },
